silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_03_olog_node_arrow_law_yoneda_hom_leg_6_P_measure silm:hasExample "In 'P1803_olog_node_arrow_lawYonedaHomLeg6', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, contravariant action P(isMeasuredBy): P(BodyMassMeasurement) -> P(BodyMassQuality) recovering the quality of Mittens' 4.2 kg" .
